  "bugs_found_by_running_it": [
    "TimescaleDB sink wrote timestamps with a literal %f (Arrow strftime has no %f): every batch failed, and the aborted transaction then failed every later batch",
    "PostgreSQL health check passed on the Unix socket during first-time init, so migrate ran before the server accepted TCP",
    "MQTT gateway: new client id per restart plus 2 h sessions left offline members in the shared group that received and dropped a share of the traffic; messages were acknowledged before reaching Kafka",
    "EMQX defaults (32 in flight, 1,000 mailbox, 1,000 queue) throttled or disconnected the gateway once acknowledgements waited for Kafka",
    "Kafka consumers crashed on commit during a consumer-group rebalance (REBALANCE_IN_PROGRESS, ILLEGAL_GENERATION), which caused another rebalance",
    "Prometheus overwrote the metrics' service label with the target label, so per-service alerts and two dashboard panels matched nothing",
    "OpenTelemetry metrics were exported to Tempo, which answers 404"
  ]
